This covers everything under `src/`, `tests/`, `pipelines/`, `docker/` and the
written analysis in `docs/` and `notebooks/`.


================================================================================
The data
================================================================================

The listing data this project analyses comes from Inside Airbnb
(https://insideairbnb.com) and is published under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The snapshots themselves are not in this repository. What is committed are
figures, tables and captured endpoint responses derived from them, chiefly
under `docs/endpoint_demo/`, `docs/figures/`, `docs/screenshots/` and the
outputs stored in `notebooks/`. Those derived works remain under CC BY 4.0.
Reusing them requires crediting Inside Airbnb.

Host and reviewer identifiers are salted-hashed by
`src/rental_ranking/data/anonymize.py` before anything is committed or
published. The salt is not distributed, so the hashes in this repository cannot
be reversed or re-derived from a clone.

Inside Airbnb is not affiliated with Airbnb, Inc., and neither is this project.


================================================================================
Third-party dependencies
================================================================================

Runtime and development dependencies keep their own licences, which are
resolved and pinned in `uv.lock`. None of them are vendored here.
